  "title": "Gundam-san",
  "justification": "TVDB season 0 lists each short once: 1 丸出しが好き, 2 戻れないアムロさん, 3 ハロ男の哀愁, 4 女医セイラの思春期相談室, 5 and 6 ソロモンの休日 前編/後編. AniDB lists the four-part shorts part by part: S1-S4 \"Marudashi ga Suki (1)-(4)\" go to episode 1, S5-S8 \"Modorenai Amuro-san (1)-(4)\" to 2 and S10-S13 \"Haro Otoko no Aishuu (1)-(4)\" to 3; S9 \"Joi Sayla no Shishunki Soudanshitsu\" is 4 and S14/S15 \"Solomon no Kyuujitsu Zenpen/Kouhen\" are 5 and 6. By default S1-S6 fell on episodes 1-6 in number order. S16-S58 (the Kotowaza shorts and later specials) have no TVDB episode and are unmapped.",
